{"segments": [
 {"id": "c02-title-01", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Chapter two. A relative needs a clause after it.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["title"]},
 {"id": "c02-title-02", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "en", "text": "This word alone means nothing.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["sub"]},
 {"id": "c02-title-03", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "ar", "text": "الَّذِي", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["ar:0"]},
 {"id": "c02-title-04", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "en", "text": "The one who did what? We wait for more.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c02-title-05", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "en", "text": "The clause after it completes its meaning. This clause is called the ṣila.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c02-title-06", "scene": "c02-title", "lang": "ar", "text": "صِلَةٌ", "pause": 0.7, "cues": ["ar:1"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-01", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "First. The student who passed came.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:1"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-02", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "جَاءَ الطَّالِبُ الَّذِي نَجَحَ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:0"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-03", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "The ṣila is just the verb. It means he passed.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:1"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-04", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "نَجَحَ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:1"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-05", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "Second. This is the girl who wrote the lesson.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:2"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-06", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "هَذِهِ هِيَ الْبِنْتُ الَّتِي كَتَبَتِ الدَّرْسَ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:2"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-07", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "The ṣila means she wrote the lesson.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:2"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-08", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "كَتَبَتِ الدَّرْسَ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:3"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-09", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "Third. The book which is on the desk is new.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:3"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-10", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "الْكِتَابُ الَّذِي عَلَى الْمَكْتَبِ جَدِيدٌ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:4"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-11", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "Here the ṣila has no verb. It is a place phrase: on the desk.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:3", "hl:a place phrase"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-12", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "عَلَى الْمَكْتَبِ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:5"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-13", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "Fourth. The men who sat in the mosque went out.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:4"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-14", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "خَرَجَ الرِّجَالُ الَّذِينَ جَلَسُوا فِي الْمَسْجِدِ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:6"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-15", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "en", "text": "The ṣila means they sat in the mosque.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["note:4"]},
 {"id": "c02-ex-16", "scene": "c02-ex", "lang": "ar", "text": "جَلَسُوا فِي الْمَسْجِدِ", "pause": 0.8, "cues": ["ar:7"]},
 {"id": "c02-tip-01", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "A tip. The ṣila has a small link back to the noun.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["show", "hl:a small link back to the noun"]},
 {"id": "c02-tip-02", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "Often the link is hidden in the verb.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c02-tip-03", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "ar", "text": "نَجَحَ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["ar:0"]},
 {"id": "c02-tip-04", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "This verb means he passed. The hidden he is the student.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c02-tip-05", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "Sometimes the link is an attached pronoun. The student whose house is near.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c02-tip-06", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "ar", "text": "الطَّالِبُ الَّذِي بَيْتُهُ قَرِيبٌ", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["ar:1"]},
 {"id": "c02-tip-07", "scene": "c02-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "The small ending on house means his. It points back to the student.", "pause": 0.8, "cues": []}
]}
